  + I03B-011 duplicate refusal before second value with first and second offsets
  + I03B-012 exact JSON number grammar component spans and source ordering
  + I03B-013 no floating conversion as ingress oracle
  + I03B-014 exact container depth definition below at and above 128
  + I03B-015 aggregate object-member and array-item checked limits
  + I03B-016 aggregate scalar-value checked limit excluding member names

& [I03B_017_024] cover names paths accounts results and faults
