  + I03B-019 structured path segment and RFC 6901 derived rendering
  + I03B-020 zero-based offsets half-open spans and EOF offset
  + I03B-021 accepted instance exact bytes digest kind accounts and number tokens
  + I03B-022 closed stable fault code grammar limit and duplicate evidence
  + I03B-023 bounded advisory diagnostics and no engine display identity
  + I03B-024 atomic result with zero partial accepted state on fault

& [I03B_025_032] cover implementation proof and authority boundary
